So yeah, like not everybody.

803
01:02:16,800 --> 01:02:18,560
Like not everyone uses Apple.

804
01:02:20,800 --> 01:02:25,600
And sometimes even inside families, like one is iPhone user and the other is Android.

805
01:02:26,160 --> 01:02:31,360
So we need to figure out a way to make sure everyone gets it in January.

806
01:02:33,360 --> 01:02:39,200
We have no plans to build an Android app because it doesn't make any sense for us right now.

