We are still thinking and debating about it because having a new platform.

820
01:03:58,320 --> 01:04:09,200
platform, having a new complex app like Tripsi in the web, we require a lot of work from us and continued work forever more.

821
01:04:09,520 --> 01:04:15,440
Yeah, continued work like even now we're going to release a new update of Tripsi next week.

822
