Yeah, like the web, if you're using an app that has web support, you'll probably expect the same basic features and all the clients, you know.

824
01:04:36,000 --> 01:04:45,520
So maybe we are avoiding this and maybe giving you, giving the users a simple solution that resolves their problem.

825
01:04:47,520 --> 01:04:48,160
It's good enough.

826
01:04:48,800 --> 01:04:52,960
The web users are very high, lots of users using it.

