01:05:14,160 --> 01:05:32,160
And I think I may have DMed you about this a long time ago, but also it's nice because you can you can send it to somebody and they can archive it and have like a PDF version that sits somewhere because for some reason that in particular is I just want too many documents for literally everything that I have whenever I'm traveling.

830
01:05:33,440 --> 01:05:35,280
So that's yeah, that's another nice thing.

