863
01:08:32,160 --> 01:08:32,240
Yeah.

864
01:08:34,560 --> 01:08:35,600
And we need to support that.

865
01:08:35,760 --> 01:08:36,800
We need to improve that.

866
01:08:37,200 --> 01:08:45,280
So, yeah, like, that's I think that's the way we think about what, what to charge or not.

867
01:08:46,160 --> 01:08:50,560
There are other like five or six features in these updates that that's going to be free for everyone.

868
01:08:50,880 --> 01:08:53,120
So that's, that's fair enough.

869
01:08:53,520 --> 01:08:53,760
I think.

870
01:08:54,800 --> 01:08:54,880
Yeah.

871
01:08:55,120 --> 01:08:56,400
It's, it's like a tricky thing.

872
01:08:56,720 --> 01:09:01,360
And I'm in the throes of wrestling with that right now is like how to think about this kind of stuff.

873
01:09:01,440 --> 01:09:04,640
Because it's like, yeah, on the one hand, you want it's almost like you.

874
01:09:05,120 --> 01:09:13,600
want to think about what's the what is the free app and how can you make that a good experience on its own.

875
01:09:14,800 --> 01:09:17,120
But obviously that's free.

876
01:09:17,280 --> 01:09:18,720
Like you're making no money from that.

877
01:09:18,960 --> 01:09:28,080
So you want that to stay good, but then like it almost feels like anything that there are certain features that are almost required to live within that.

878
01:09:29,440 --> 01:09:30,240
That type of app.

879
01:09:30,800 --> 01:09:34,720
Whereas something like WeatherKit, that is like it's like an additive thing.

880
01:09:35,040 --> 01:09:40,480
You can use the core of what the app provides value for free users is still there with or without that.

881
01:09:41,200 --> 01:09:44,640
And also, like in our app, we don't run ads.

882
01:09:45,280 --> 01:09:48,240
We don't use the user's data for anything.

883
01:09:48,640 --> 01:09:52,640
We don't have any tracking like for the user to sell or make money from it.

884
01:09:53,360 --> 01:09:57,760
So, like the product that we are selling is StripC Pro.

885
01:09:58,160 --> 01:10:01,520
Like, if you want to support our app, you can pay for it.

886
01:10:02,240 --> 01:10:06,880
You know, we're not doing any crazy behind the scenes to make money.

887
