888
01:10:10,640 --> 01:10:11,920
Yeah, that's true.

889
01:10:12,160 --> 01:10:17,360
True, I guess it's like weather where you probably have people sniffing around trying to buy up data.

890
01:10:18,320 --> 01:10:26,400
